{"level":"cefr-idioms","note":"高價值主題例句・高頻慣用語：自寫，待獨立 reviewer 審。","items":[
  {"sentence":"It's a piece of cake.","zh":"這很簡單，輕而易舉。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's break the ice.","zh":"我們來打破僵局，暖個場。"},
  {"sentence":"Just hang in there!","zh":"再撐一下，堅持下去！"},
  {"sentence":"It's not a big deal.","zh":"這沒什麼大不了的。"},
  {"sentence":"You totally nailed it!","zh":"你完全做對了，表現超棒！"},
  {"sentence":"We're on the same page.","zh":"我們想法一致，有共識。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's call it a day.","zh":"今天就到這裡吧。"},
  {"sentence":"Break a leg tonight!","zh":"今晚祝你演出順利！"},
  {"sentence":"It's totally up to you.","zh":"這完全由你決定。"},
  {"sentence":"Hang on a second.","zh":"稍等一下。"},
  {"sentence":"I'll keep an eye on it.","zh":"我會留意、盯著它。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's play it by ear.","zh":"我們看情況隨機應變。"},
  {"sentence":"It cost an arm and a leg.","zh":"它貴得要命。"},
  {"sentence":"Just give it a shot.","zh":"就試試看吧。"},
  {"sentence":"Hey, hold your horses!","zh":"喂，別急，稍安勿躁！"},
  {"sentence":"It completely slipped my mind.","zh":"我一時完全忘了。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's get the ball rolling.","zh":"我們開始動起來吧。"},
  {"sentence":"I'm all ears now.","zh":"我洗耳恭聽。"},
  {"sentence":"That really rings a bell.","zh":"這聽起來確實有點耳熟。"},
  {"sentence":"Keep it up, everyone!","zh":"大家繼續保持！"},
  {"sentence":"It's a win-win for us.","zh":"這對我們是雙贏。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's wrap it up.","zh":"我們來收尾、結束吧。"},
  {"sentence":"No worries at all.","zh":"完全不用擔心，沒關係。"},
  {"sentence":"It's worth a shot.","zh":"這值得一試。"},
  {"sentence":"Take it easy today.","zh":"今天放輕鬆點。"},
  {"sentence":"We're in the same boat.","zh":"我們處境相同。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's touch base next week.","zh":"我們下週再聯絡、對一下進度。"},
  {"sentence":"Just make up your mind.","zh":"快拿定主意吧。"},
  {"sentence":"The plan is crystal clear.","zh":"這計畫非常清楚明白。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's cut to the chase.","zh":"我們直接講重點吧。"},
  {"sentence":"I've got your back.","zh":"我會挺你、罩著你。"},
  {"sentence":"It's a long shot.","zh":"這希望不大、機會渺茫。"},
  {"sentence":"Just let it go.","zh":"放下吧，別放在心上。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's keep in touch.","zh":"我們保持聯絡吧。"},
  {"sentence":"Dinner is on me tonight.","zh":"今晚晚餐我請客。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's split the bill.","zh":"我們平分帳單吧。"},
  {"sentence":"Wow, time really flies!","zh":"哇，時間過得真快！"},
  {"sentence":"Better late than never.","zh":"遲到總比沒到好。"},
  {"sentence":"So far, so good.","zh":"目前為止一切順利。"},
  {"sentence":"It's not rocket science.","zh":"這又沒那麼難、沒那麼複雜。"},
  {"sentence":"Let me sleep on it.","zh":"讓我考慮一晚再決定。"},
  {"sentence":"Come on, you've got this!","zh":"加油，你辦得到！"},
  {"sentence":"It's a total no-brainer.","zh":"這根本不用考慮，顯而易見。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's hit the road now.","zh":"我們現在出發上路吧。"},
  {"sentence":"Come on, pull yourself together.","zh":"拜託，振作起來。"},
  {"sentence":"The trip is up in the air.","zh":"這趟旅行還沒定，懸而未決。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's clear the air first.","zh":"我們先把話說開吧。"},
  {"sentence":"Sorry, I'm running late.","zh":"抱歉，我快遲到了。"},
  {"sentence":"Can you give me a hand?","zh":"你能幫我一下嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"Keep your chin up!","zh":"別灰心，振作點！"}
]}
